WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.300
In case you haven't heard the news:

2
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:03.360
the first alpaca café has opened in Serbia.

3
00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:06.340
Not far from Zrenjanin, at the "Trofej" restaurant,

4
00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:07.820
there is a small oasis

5
00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:09.820
where these cutest creatures are waiting for you.

6
00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:12.720
At the entrance you pay 1200 dinars for a ticket,

7
00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:14.640
which gets you unlimited drinks.

8
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.200
If you follow the rules you are given at the start,

9
00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:19.660
you get food to feed the alpacas.

10
00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:22.540
Each has her own special name and special character,

11
00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:24.720
but I think you, like me, won't be able to decide

12
00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:25.680
which one is your favorite,

13
00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:27.100
because each one is special in her own way.

14
00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:28.440
They are very friendly and affectionate,

15
00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:30.820
especially if you have a carrot in your hand.

16
00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:33.280
You approach alpacas only from the front,

17
00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:35.560
so they can see you and notice what is approaching them.

18
00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:36.900
(unclear) ... strictly forbidden,

19
00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:38.580
so as not to harm their health,

20
00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:40.260
but you can take photos and film,

21
00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:41.440
as they say, as much as your heart desires.

22
00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:43.280
It really is an unforgettable experience,

23
00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:45.300
and everyone who has the chance should visit them.